1
00:00:00,275 --> 00:00:04,599
AI doesn't think like us—it turns messy words and pixels into math.

2
00:00:05,175 --> 00:00:09,734
Inside its neural network, millions of connected weights pass signals layer by layer.

3
00:00:10,375 --> 00:00:14,934
Attention layers compare every token at once, locking onto hidden patterns and context.

4
00:00:15,575 --> 00:00:20,020
During training, it guesses, checks the error, and tunes those weights backward.

5
00:00:20,775 --> 00:00:25,386
When generating an answer, it scores every option and picks the best match.

6
00:00:25,975 --> 00:00:29,547
Scale data and math together—and patterns start acting like intelligence.
